    "Only complete four-second windows within source duration may be used. Label 1 requires at least 50 percent accepted positive-interval coverage; these recording decisions do not automatically label every window. No label 0 events were accepted.",
    "Prop scenes are excluded; uncertain gestures or short/unclear contact sequences are ambiguous with empty events. Empty events do not imply normal footage.",
    "All VID footage belongs to one training cohort. Actor/session lineage is unknown; descriptive scene groups establish no independence and cannot create calibration or holdout groups.",
    "Consent and CC0 information are publisher/author-reported as documented in the shared source evidence; this review adds no independent release verification."
